window.products.push({"id":877032,"name":"MEMNUN Butter Dish with Water, Ceramics Water Sealed French Butter Keeper with Lid for Fresh Soft Butter (Turquoise)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qjjZcCIxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💦【Keep The Butter Soft, More Freshness You Have】With this Water Sealed French Butter Dish, when you need your butter, just take it out of room temperature and use it. With soft and easy to spread butter at hand, life is much more convenient. Avoid the embarrassment of having to wait to defrost after taking the cold butter out of the fridge, allowing you to enjoy it as quickly as possible. 💦【Large Capacity for east/west coast butter】Butter tray outside size 7.7x4.1x0.6\", inside size 6.2x2.6x0.8\", suitable for the complete \"American size\" butter. Designed for all butter sticks, including east and west coast butter. 💦【Wide Applicaton and Makes a great gift 】The butter dish with lid also as a small “cutting board” for slicing. It would be perfect for a picnic to serve cheese or whatnot as you can use the bottom as a little serving platter. You also can use it for a small food like cake, cookies, the lid will keep the pet out of your food. It is perfect as a gift for housewarming, birthday, wedding, Holloween, Tksgiving Day, Christmas and more. 💦【Easy to Use】Pour cold water into the base below outside edge, then replace lid into the base. An airtight seal protects and preserves butter’s flavor and freshness without fridge. You can put it at the countertop indoor below the temperature of 28℃. Remember to change water per 2-3 days. 💦【Updated Water Sealed French butter dish】Do you still find a perfect ceramic butter dish for butter freshness without refrigeration? Updated butter dish with lid is the best choice, which deigns higher inside edge to store water, creating an airtight space to keep butter fresh and flavor without fridge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qjjZcCIxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEMNUN","source_asin":"B09G5LL1Q1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G5LL1Q1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G5LL1Q1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
