window.products.push({"id":877166,"name":"GODR7OY Silicone Ice Cube Trays with Lid 2 Pack, Reusable and BPA Free(Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ALHbE00sL._AC_SL1443_.jpg","description":"Description The ice cubes made by the mold are small and cute, and the size of the ice cubes made is 2*1.5cm.The honeycomb ice cube mold has a total of 37 mold holes. You can make a variety of ice cubes with your favorite flavors and put them in the prepared beverages. After use, the mold can be cleaned manually or in the dishwasher. Ice cube trays are resistant from - 40 ° f to 446 ° F and can be used in ovens, microwave ovens and other machines. The soft silicone material is soft and feels comfortable. The hard 6-wall surface supports the shape of the ice cube, making it not easy to deform. The soft design at the bottom can make the frozen ice cube easily pop out. Parameter Single mold size: 12*20*2cm Size with cover: 12.5*20.5*2.5cm Single mold weight: 88.1 grams Mould weight with lid: 123.6g Quantity: 2PCS","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ALHbE00sL._AC_SL1443_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GODR7OY","source_asin":"B08F7TJCRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7TJCRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7TJCRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":877167,"name":"JÁCLER Queen Size Zippered Mattress Encasement | Waterproof Mattress Protector | Protects Fluids | Fits Up to 16 Inch Mattress (Queen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PfgoMshiL._AC_.jpg","description":"★MATTRESS ENCASEMENT - Fits QUEEN size mattress perfectly with dimensions 60 inches by 80 inches; 16 inches deep pocket ★KNITTED WATERPROOF FABRIC - Stretchable knitted polyester fabric fits the mattress easily and gives a comfortable feel while you sleep; PVC waterproof TPU backing on all sides resist any leakage into the mattress ★ZIPPERED COVER - Zippered cover with zip guard secures the mattress from 360 degrees; it protects the mattress from fluids ★OEKO-TEX CERTIFIED - Oeko-Tex Standard 100 factory certification ensures that the fabric meets the safety and environmental standards","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PfgoMshiL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JÁCLER","source_asin":"B08BS5Y6SV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BS5Y6SV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BS5Y6SV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":877168,"name":"Wrapables Large Reusable Shopping Tote Bag with Outer Pouch, Floral Rabbits","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oyT7Zjw6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say goodbye to flimsy one-time use plastic bags, and hello to our stylish reusable bags. These reusable bags can be used over and over again, thereby reducing plastic pollution. All of our reusable bags are made out of polyester that is standard 100 by OEKO-TEX certified, meaning that the bags are better for the environment, Free from harmful chemicals and dyes, and safe for human use. Able to carry up to 50 pounds due to its double-layered reinforced handles, these bags are strong and durable. The bottom of the bag is Seamless, which is stronger than two pieces of fabric stitched together. This prevents the bottom from tearing due to a heavy load. The bags are also water resistant, and will not fade after washing. With its Large and roomy capacity, these sturdy bags are perfect for carrying extra groceries, books, or for going shopping, running errands, or traveling. Also, the fun and eye-catching designs on these reusable bags will make you stand out from the crowd. Conveniently take these lightweight bags with you anywhere; they fold up into a small and compact size when not in use. Comes with an outer pouch for storage. a single plastic bag can take hundreds of years to biodegrade. They end up in our landfills and waterways and release toxic chemicals into the environment as they break down. During this time, plastic bags also pose a threat to animals who mistake them for food or become trapped in the debris. By using reusable bags instead, we can reduce the damage to our environment caused by plastic pollution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oyT7Zjw6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wrapables","source_asin":"B081R778TS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081R778TS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081R778TS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":877169,"name":"BONNIU Decorative Throw Pillow Case Cover with Zipper 20X20 Velvet Pillow Sham 50X50 cm Landscape Art - Monet - Landscape Near Montecarlo 1883","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P5O0d+xxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WWW*BONNIU*COM is a high-end manufacturing firm specializing in the production of art pillowcases (3D-printed with famous oil paintings). Please contact us!The soft velvet pillow case cover is warm in winter while comfortable in spring, summer and fall. Excellent decor pillowcase for daily decoration, Halloween, Christmas, Easter, Thanksgiving, Valentine day, birthday and other holidays etc. This print art cushion cover is suitable for anywhere indoors such as home, sofa, bed, chair, hammock, couch, bookshelf, living room, bedroom, office, outdoor and indoor decorations. Take these fashionable pillow protector to change your home decor easily while reusing your own pillows. The casual pillow case cover is best gift for anybody, both adults and children, man and woman, boy and girl, toddler and teenager etc. A random pillow sham or loose pillowcase makes a great gift for anyone who enjoys deep, restorative sleep, a perfect gift for her or him!Square pillowcase size: ca. 20X20 inch / 50X50 cm.  Package: 1 pcs pillowcase cover, no insert nor filler. You are strongly recommended to buy several pieces to show as pillow cases set. How to choose a pillow core for this pillowcase? For a luxurious and full looking pillow, please choose inserts that are 1 to 4 inches ( 2.5-10cm ) larger than the pillowcase cover that you'll be using.  Or you can buy smaller pillow filler, if you want it to be able to fluff and conform. How to Install a pillow filler into a pillowcase cover? 1. Open the pillow core package and let it fluffy. 2. Fold the pillow core. 3. Push fit the pillow core into the pillow case cover and close the zipper. 4. Pat evenly the pillow. 5. Completed. gsm=grams per square meter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P5O0d+xxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BONNIU","source_asin":"B08VWVHVNC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VWVHVNC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VWVHVNC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
