window.products.push({"id":877185,"name":"2 Tier Modern Farmhouse Tray - Wood Cake Stand for Farmhouse Tiered Tray Decor, Mugs, Spices. Kitchen Decor for Counter / Island Great with Wood, Blac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91arHuYY1ZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Not just for rustic or distressed style kitchens, less rustic tray and more modern farmhouse decor this chic wooden tiered stand provides the same function as a farmhouse tray but is much more versatile with its cleaner more elegant look that will suit any style kitchen. Additionally they are bang on trend for 2022 as counter, table or island decorations for kitchen, made of a smooth mid-oak coloring solid wood, unbelievably popular in all kitchen design magazines and tying in beautifully with our love of natural wood and oak stools, flooring, counters, feature chopping blocks, it also includes 3 different colour handles for whether you have antique brass / gold, silver or black metals accents. Made in a stylish neutral natural genuine wood and showing gorgeous grain to the max, this large round tiered centerpiece is a more elegant two-tier tray that will work in any home !!! Tidy your kitchen counter top or island by using it as an organizer the wood tiered tray stand for your tea cannisters and mugs, coffee bar accessories, herbs, oils and spice rack, anything you choose! Or simply create a stunning centrepiece for your island or counter by arranging seasonal decorations at Christmas, Easter, Valentines, Fall, birthdays etc, beautiful plants and ornaments or inspirational quotes etc. Let your imagination run wild! This wood is correctly seasoned over sufficient time , so it will not warp and the natural finish means it is free from flaky paint and odours. Unlike most other products of this type, this 2 tiered tray is exceptionally sturdy as the pieces screw together rather than sliding loosely onto a pole and consequently is free from wobbles. Also unusually we provide an extender piece, which will provide extra space between the trays for your of taller items. Wood tray centerpieces for tables, counters or islands are the perfect gift for anyone who loves to improve their kitchen space either practically or creatively ... or both !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91arHuYY1ZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blossomsie","source_asin":"B091Q5X2KC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091Q5X2KC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091Q5X2KC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
