window.products.push({"id":877246,"name":"Neato Botvac DC02 Connected Robotic Vacuum Wi Fi Enabled","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SBvN4FLtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Ultimate Navigating Wi-Fi Connected Robot Vacuum. Fully-featured, award-winning Botvac Connected is the smartest, most powerful, versatile solution for automatically clean floors, everyday. With dual cleaning modes and a wide cleaning path, Botvac Connected efficiently cleans room-to-room, recharges automatically and resumes cleaning until the entire floor is clean. Works on all floor types. Use the Neato app to clean your floors anytime, from anywhere. Great for homes with pets and allergies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SBvN4FLtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neato Robotics","source_asin":"B01HT6N6SA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HT6N6SA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HT6N6SA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":877247,"name":"Cleanbear Washcloths 100% Cotton Wash Cloths, Highly Absorbent Soft Washcloth Set, Great for Face, Body or Gift 3-Pack 13 x 13 Inches (Avocado Yellow)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ns9GIzhxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cotton Wash Cloths - The washcloths are made of 100% cotton that is great for daily cleaning use such as bathing or face cleaning Dense Loops - There are more than 144 terry loops per square inch that make the cloths highly absorbent. It can absorb the weight of water more than 5 times of its own 3-Pack - There are 3 wash clothes packaged together that is not too many for you to have a dry about Cleanbear Towels if don’t want to buy bulk products Portable and Giftable- The minimalist package is portable that is great for travelling or outdoor use. The quantity of 3 is not too formal nor too casual to show your kindness Well-considered Details - All of the edges are reinforced for long lasting and there is hanging ring at the corner for easy care","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ns9GIzhxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cleanbear","source_asin":"B087TSRSZX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087TSRSZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087TSRSZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":877248,"name":"Tactical Safety Essentials Cooling Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l6K0VgwdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When the temperature rises, it's always better to be prepared. No matter what hot situation you find yourself in, whether recovering from a run or discovering your AC has broken down, this cooling towel is always there only a quick soak and snap away from taking your \"it's too hot\" woes away. Our cooling towels are 25 x 17 inches and are thicker than most PVA towels on the market today. They get even colder than microfiber towels and stay cool longer. It's the better choice for long lasting heat relief. What else do you need? There are no complicated instructions here. Simply remove the cooling towel, soak it in cold water, wring it out, give a quick \"snap\" and its ready to drape around your neck. If it starts to get warmer, simply rinse and repeat and stay cool while fishing, hunting, hiking or even on the job. This cooling towel also makes the perfect gift for the whole family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l6K0VgwdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tactical Safety Essentials","source_asin":"B01EMUBTP8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EMUBTP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EMUBTP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
