window.products.push({"id":877250,"name":"Set of Three Wood Carving Bowl Adze Tools - Straight - Big - Small Curved Adze","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715RO5CjljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 3 cast and after that forged and tempered sculpting, woodcarving and a woodworking adzes. Excellent quality - reasonable price!!! This is THE ULTIMATE woodworking, woodcarving adzes SET! It contains: 1. Straight Adze 2. Big curve Adze 3. Small curve Adze All of the adzes combines sharp blade and claw hammer. Excellent steel - AISI-4150 or ГОСТ-50X HRC~ 50-55 The whole in the center is for pulling nails. Very useful and well balanced. Very sharp and durable blades. You can cut even nails with the blade... Traditional use of the adze is for removing bark and trimming or shaping timber. Authentic log home builders, as well as traditional shipbuilders, make use of the adze. Artists and sculptors use various sizes of adzes for making totem poles, masks and bowls. Craftspeople who follow age-old customs use adzes for making barrel staves, forming chair seats and making bowls and troughs. The adze head have conic shape of the eye. The handle is from beech tree and it is made at lathe. It have conic shape also and fits perfectly to the adze eye. The handle is removable because of the easy sharpening of the adze blade as it should be! You will receive the adze removed out of the handle and you should mount it tight. It is a \"slip fit\" type of handle. The unnecessary part of the handle should be cuted appr half inch from the adze. If you have questions about mounting of the handle - please message me! Different shape of the blades allows big variety of woodworking operations. As you may see I'm selling this adzes separately in my listings. Dimensions: Handle - 36 cm. ~ 14 inches Head - 550 Grams (g) - 1.2 Pounds (lbs.) Please use the photos to help judge content and condition. If you are unsure in anyway please ask.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715RO5CjljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mapsyst","source_asin":"B010LS578A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010LS578A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010LS578A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":877251,"name":"AmazerBath Soap Dispenser for Kitchen 2 in 1 Dish Soap Dispenser and Sponge Holder Premium Soap Dispenser for Kitchen, Sink, Countertop - Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hyz36LfcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgraded design: Unlike other soap dispensers, the soap dispenser's hollow gaps and slant design lets water drain down to the bottom tray. There is a separate tray above the container lid which easily removes to pour water out, ensuring the sponge does not become smelly. Easy to use: This soap dispenser only needs one hand to apply soap, just press down on the top tray from any direction to dispense soap directly onto the sponge. The ergonomic radian design saves time, energy, and is more convenient than other traditional dispensers. Convenient and neat: The top tray of this soap dispenser is designed for putting sponges, scrubbers, or rags. It really helps in saving space and keeping water off of counters. Durable and sturdy: The soap dispenser is made of premium plastic, and the lid is snapped onto the soap container firmly. You don't need to worry about the soap will come out if the soap dispenser flipped. Soap saver: This soap dispenser will dispense the right amount of soap onto the sponge, which can reduce the waste of soap. It is also has a large capacity of 14.8 ounces to allow its use for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Hyz36LfcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AmazerBath","source_asin":"B08RYG18NT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RYG18NT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RYG18NT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
