window.products.push({"id":877264,"name":"Lake House Corkscrew (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7191Mtlcb7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Avoid struggling with a particularly tough wine cork by purchasing one of our corkscrews! These handy wine openers can be customized to complement the rest of your bar accessories, making for functional touches of decor to any counter-top or shelf.Built from a robust stainless steel, this wine bottle opener features winged grippers that let you remove the cork with little to no resistance. Your personalized corkscrew also includes a circular turn-handle at its top. At 7 inches long, you can easily store this wine corkscrew in a drawer or a shelf. Your customization is printed on both sides of the turn-handle, and can be customized individually.To use this nifty tool, simply twist into the cork, push down on the handles, and remove the cork! Removing corks will always be an effortless process, thanks to these special wine openers. If you ever need to clean it, we advise that you wipe it down with a lightly dampened rag and some detergent.Design Shown: Lake House (#680507)Features:==================================== * [Durable construction]: Robust stainless steel ensures long-lasting use and reliability. * [Winged grippers]: Effortlessly remove corks with minimal resistance using winged handles. * [Easy-to-use design]: Twist, push, and remove corks with a user-friendly circular turn-handle. * [Compact size]: At 7\" x 2.5\", conveniently store the corkscrew in a drawer or on a shelf.Care Instructions:==================================== * Wipe down corkscrew with lightly dampened rag and detergent to cleanUsage Instructions:==================================== * Twist tip into cork, push down handles, and remove cork","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7191Mtlcb7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B0764YXVMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0764YXVMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0764YXVMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
