window.products.push({"id":877360,"name":"Herman Miller Classic Aeron Chair - Fully Adjustable, A size, Adjustable Lumbar, Carpet Casters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ijzrsAAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed by Bill Stumpf and Don Chadwick for Herman Miller, this groundbreaking chair made ergonomics a part of our everyday work life. The chair's organic curves align naturally with the human body. The breathable Pellicle woven suspension material resists heat buildup and distributes weight to eliminate pressure points. And the lumbar support pad adjusts to fit the curve of the midback. Building on the designers' belief that everyone deserves a great chair, Classic Aeron comes in three sizes—small (A), medium (B), and large (C)—to fit the most comprehensive range of people of any office chair. Guided by a height-weight ratio, Herman Miller recommends the Size A chair for people up to 5'4\" in height who weigh less than 150 pounds. People with body types outside that range should consider Size B or C chairs. With its legendary comfort and distinctive aesthetic, Classic Aeron exemplifies the art and science of seating. Its design is part of the permanent collection at the Museum of Modern Art in New York. An environmentally sensitive design, Classic Aeron is made largely of materials that are recyclable at the end of its useful life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ijzrsAAPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Herman Miller","source_asin":"B01DGI2EZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DGI2EZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DGI2EZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
