window.products.push({"id":877383,"name":"VISTA Kayan 11 x 11 inch Picture Frame, Thin Profile in White, Wide Mat w 4 x 4 inch Opening","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411xrm2PYaL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Vista Kayan collection, inspired by the rainforest that is situated on the border of Malaysia and Indonesia is a minimalist monument. Historically, this forest park has been notoriously difficult to enter, but thankfully due to some efforts of the Heart of Borneo initiative progress is being made. The slimmest of the Vista frame profiles, this frame is truly the epitome of \"less is more\". Ultra sophistacted and never fighting for attention, the Kayan instantly captures your heart. Available in white, silver, and our current favorite- gold. Get them all for all the different places you will go. At Vista, we aim to keep the ecology of our Earth at the top of the minds of \"consumers\". Our frames preserve their contents, and keep them beautiful. Our process preserves the Earth, keeping it beautiful. We know it’s important to feel good about what you buy, so \"picture this\" for a moment... We pick up tons and tons of polystyrene [aka Styrofoam] from all over the world, process it into tiny pellets, and turn it into the material we use for our frames. All the while keeping it out of landfills! Doing good by creating things that look good in your home. So go ahead, and enjoy your Vista.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411xrm2PYaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vista","source_asin":"B0746FZ4HK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0746FZ4HK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0746FZ4HK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
