window.products.push({"id":877467,"name":"KQYT Digital Cooking Food Meat Thermometer Meat Thermometer for Grill Smoker Kitchen Candy Oven BBQ with Smart Cooking Timer Mode and Large LCD Backli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XQWb6ZpfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"KQYT Perfect cooking food thermometer for Oven, BBQ, Grill KQYT digital meat thermometer is an easy and effective cooking tool to get the most accurate temperature. Just insert the probe into the thickest part of the meat, and the BBQ thermometer can display a temperature reading precisely and quickly. The meat thermometer with a large LCD display and high resistance probe, reading temperatures is simple in your preferred unit of measurement between Celsius or Fahrenheit. With strong magnets and a stand on the back, this food thermometer can be attached on the fridge, oven and smoker or be put on the table with a stand. By using the oven thermometer with preset temperatures for 9 types of meat and their various doneness levels recommended by USDA, stop overcooking or under-cooking your food and perfect food temperatures like a professional, ensuring the perfect temp every time you're grilling or cooking. FOOD Thermometer Features: 1.Ultra-clear screen LCD backlight display assists you to see the reading more clearly in dim light conditions.  2. Programmed with preset USDA approved temperatures for 8 types of meat (BEEF, PORK, CHICKEN, TURKEY, VEAL, LAMB, HAMBURGER, FISH).  3. Programmed with preset USDA approved 5 kinds of degrees of doneness (WELL, M WELL, MEDIUM, M RARE, RARE).  4. Program your own temperature settings manually.  5. Count up or count down to a maximum of 99 minutes and 59 seconds with alarm alert.  6. Celsius/Fahrenheit selector. Important Notes: 1.Do not make the probe expose to open flame or other objects with a temperature exceeding 482°F, otherwise the probe will be damaged.  2.If the temperature exceeds or falls below the measurable ranges, the LCD screen will display the following letters: HHH for temperatures above range a above range and LLL for temperatures below range.  3.Never use the thermometer in a closed oven.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XQWb6ZpfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KQYT","source_asin":"B08733RTL3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877467","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08733RTL3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08733RTL3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
