window.products.push({"id":877649,"name":"Banneton Bread Proofing Basket Set - HomeChef's Bakery Proofing Basket - Bread Baking Supplies & Bread Making Kit - 9 Inch Proofing Baskets, Cloth Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kwWCXxFTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Often called the ‘Staff of Life, ’there’s no denying that bread is back! And with HomeChef’s Bakery Complete Breadmaking Kit, we provide you with the finest quality baking equipment to get the job done in your home kitchen. Our kit includes the following breadmaking essentials: 1 Bread Proofing Banneton Basket 1 Bread Proofing Banneton Basket 1 Linen Basket Liner 1 Linen Basket Liner 1 Bread Cloth Bag 1 Bread Cloth Bag 1 Premium Bread Lame w/5 replacement blades 1 Premium Bread Lame w/5 replacement blades 1 Stainless Steel Scraper 1 Stainless Steel Scraper 1 Dough Whisk 1 Dough Whisk 1 Premium Silicone Bread Kneading Mat 1 Premium Silicone Bread Kneading Mat Perfect sourdough is not just for trained bakers any more. Even the baking rookie can create beautiful artisan boule (French for bowl, pronounced boo-lay) loaves, and we’re here to help you every step of the way with utensils and equipment specifically selected for their durability & ease of use. Our hand-woven rattan wicker Banneton Basket allows you to create a beautiful boule-shaped loaf. Simply place up to 2 pounds of your dough into the basket and the natural weave of the rattan will transfer to the loaf, giving it an appearance that will impress your dinner guests or family. For a more creative look, you can wrap the basket with the included linen Basket Liner, and then after proofing carefully carve your unique design into the loaf with the included Bread Lame (pronounced lahm) and blade. When it’s time to turn your dough out, we’ve included a Stainless Steel Scraper & Silicone Bread Kneading Mat for quick prep work. Whether you’re making regular sourdough from a starter that’s been passed down to you lovingly from friend or family, or you’re creating your own loaf of bread or gluten-free creation, trust each of the quality seven items in this exclusive set from HomeChef’s Bakery. Makes a perfect gift! We stand behind every set, and are happy to answer any questions you might have. We are a small company that specializes in cooking and baking utensils, and love to hear from our customers. We’re pass","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kwWCXxFTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeChef's Bakery","source_asin":"B08JYRP559","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JYRP559","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JYRP559","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
