window.products.push({"id":877657,"name":"Torque Activated Pressure Sensitive Seals Cap Liners - 24 mm (0.94\") -100 PCS - for Glass & Plastic Bottles & Containers - No Induction Sealer Needed ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917nt1ykKIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PLEASE CONSULT YELLOW CHART in Pictures Section of the listing to choose correct size for your liners. These polystyrene botlle and jar foam liner seals coated with torque-activated adhesive require no tools and no heat induction equipment. For proper application consider the following recommendations: ● Make sure your pressure sensitive liner size matches the bottle or jar opening.  These 24 mm (0.94 inches) seals are to be used with any bottles or jars that use 24 mm caps ● Completely clean the jar top with clean cloth and alcohol to clear of liquid  and/or solids. Center jar seal on top of you plastic or glass bottle or jar, and apply. The white  side of the seal shall be facing down, the side with red letters shall be facing up. ● Screw metal or plastic cap on bottle. Make sure the liner and cap are tightly secured on the container. ● Once the cap is applied, it should not be removed for at least 24 hours to ensure proper adhesion. Although depending on your application, the adhesion process might take significantly less time. ● Seals can be used with glass and plastic bottles or jars and with lined or unlined caps. These pressure sensitive liners are best for use with powder or dry products . ● Avoid overfilling your containers! ● Once seal is removed, it cannot be reapplied. ● Not suitable for applications containing oil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917nt1ykKIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Advanced Girl","source_asin":"B07Q26JQYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877657","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q26JQYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q26JQYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":877658,"name":"Mariposa Palm Tree Bamboo Napkin Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81erXPms18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A vibrant palm tree decorates the cocktail napkins paired with a handcrafted Palm Tree Napkin Weight and Bamboo Napkin Box. At Mariposa, we celebrate the passion of food and the splendor of making others feel at home. In short, we have a gift for entertaining. Our unique collections are a result of our own innovative designers collaborating with superior artisans worldwide to bring the best of foreign cultures back home—from Italian glassware to aluminum gifts and tableware from Mexico. Our assortment ranges from high art to whimsical, and touches on a variety of price points. The majority of our designs are crafted from 100% recycled materials, thereby giving the planet a good return along the way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81erXPms18L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARIPOSA","source_asin":"B000KKW7E2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877658","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000KKW7E2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000KKW7E2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
