window.products.push({"id":877670,"name":"Chefman Toaster Oven, Countertop Convection Stainless Steel Oven w/Variable Temperature Control; Large 6 Slice; 6 Cooking Functions: Bake, Broil, Conv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i1vMXOF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPACIOUS SIX SLICE CAPACITY: The Chefman Countertop Convection Toaster Oven has an extra-large & deep 19 liter interior that can fit 6 slices of toast, a 10’’ pizza, and most baking pans. The three rack positions give you flexibility to cook and bake food of any size, from roast to cookies. Simply want to make toast? It features an option to select the desired level of toast, from light to dark ADVANCED COOKING TECHNOLOGY: This powerful oven has many cooking functions to bake, broil, convection bake, toast, keep warm and defrost, as well as a variable temperature range from 200-450° F. The convection bake setting results in faster and more evenly cooked food by circulating heat throughout the toaster CONVENIENT: Enjoy the convenience of countertop cooking with this convection toaster-oven; 30 minute countdown timer features ready signal bell so you know when your food is ready, while large glass door gives you visibility of your food as it cooks. Preparing a whole meal? Use the Warm function to keep your food warm until you’re ready to eat EASY CLEAN: Removable crumb tray, bake tray and two wire racks are dishwasher safe, offering quick and easy cleanup. After cooking greasy foods, let the oven cool and clean the top interior to ensure your oven will perform like new. Removing the grease will help keep toasting consistent, cycle after cycle RESOURCES: cETL approved with advanced safety technology for long lasting durability, & 1-year assurance provided by Chefman, so you can purchase worry-free - we've got your back! For information on how to use your product, scroll down for a PDF User Guide. 1380 Watts/120 Volts Included components: Baking tray, crumb tray, and two wire racks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i1vMXOF8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B075X21D8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075X21D8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075X21D8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
