window.products.push({"id":877803,"name":"Focus Line Touchless Soap Dispenser Wall Mounted 1000ML Gel/Liquid, Automatic Hand Free Dish Soap Dispenser for Kitchen Bathroom Restaurants Public","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513YtUzlG3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Focus Line Automatic Soap Dispenser Wall Mount, Automatic Hand Soap Dispenser, Hand Sanitizer Dispenser 1000ML Large Capacity, Touchless Soap Dispenser for Bathroom Kitchen Hotel Hospital School Features ✔️Touchless automatic dispensers with infrared sensor, fully automatic non-touch operation ✔️1000ml/35.2oz large capacity detachable soap liquid bottle design can suffice your long time using. ✔️Lock design for easy maintenance, suitable for commercial public places & household use ✔️Non-drip design & Wall-mounted design to save space. ✔️Just put your hand under the sensor to start the soap dispenser, and you can effectively keep it clean without touching the soap dispenser.  ✔️It is suitable for Offices Hotels Hospitals Schools Kitchen Bedroom Public places So if you're looking for a tidy solution to help keep both hands and bathroom clean, you can not miss this soap dispenser. Specification Product Name: Automatic Soap Dispenser Wall Mount Material: ABS Plastic + electric component Capacity: 1000ml/35.2oz Sensor Range: <10cm(6.5 inch) Power Source: Powered by 4 batteries (1.5V, Size C)or recharged by DC adapter(6V1A, Optional),(NOT INCLUDE battery or DC adapter) Size: 26*12.5*11cm/ 10.22*4.91*4.32inch (L*W*H) READ BEFORE INSTALLATION 1. Install the dispenser 40CM/15inch above the tabletop, in case it keeps dispensing soap. 2. In order to prolong the service life, please do not install it in direct sunlight, wet places. 3. Don’t install on the mirror surface or under strong direct light, reflection & strong light will harm the infrared sensor. 4. Use non-granular, non-foaming liquid soap, or hand sanitizer. Maintenance: Clean the outlet regular to avoid clogging, filling warm water, and operate several times Any question please contact us, we will do our best to let you have a happy shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513YtUzlG3L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Focus Line","source_asin":"B08FSVYCCJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FSVYCCJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FSVYCCJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
