window.products.push({"id":877830,"name":"Kitchen Nylon Heat Resistant Potato Masher - Large Handle Long Nonstick Utensils Dishwasher Safe - Non Stick Handheld Potato Masher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cnZ69eonL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This nonstick potato masher is ideal for pulping and mixing soft fruit, like bananas, kiwis and more, you can also use our mashers to beat or fold eggs into your baking mixes. The non stick potato masher is also heat resistant so this masher wont melt when using it. This nylon potato masher is dishwasher safe, making clean up quick and easy. This potato masher isnt just for mashing potatoes- you can also use this masher to make guacamole beans cauliflower or apple sauce. The handheld potato masher is heat resistant without warping or bending. This potato masher dishwasher safe is made of food grade nylon. The potato masher nylon makes it easier than ever to get smooth mashed potatoes in seconds. The masher nylon is made of sturdy nylon so you can easily mash potatoes vegetables fruits and more. The kitchen masher can be stored in your littele drawer. The hand masher is safe to use on all types of cookware including non-stick and coated. This heat resistant nylon masher is bpa-free and safe for non-stick cookware. This kitchen utensils masher makes mashing comfortable and easy. The potato masher long handle is 100% dishwasher safe making clean up. This large potato masher wont scratch nonstick cookware. The kitchen hand masher makes this masher safe for use on non-stick surfaces so you wont ruin your expensive non-stick cookware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cnZ69eonL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OFXDD","source_asin":"B088R93Z1H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877830","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088R93Z1H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088R93Z1H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":877831,"name":"Dehumidifiers, Electric Portable Dehumidifier with 50 oz Water Tank, Dual Cooling Chip and LED display with Automatic humidity sensing / Timer / Auto ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uw5z-iLiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1.💧2022 NEWEST UPGRADED DEHUMIDIFIERS: COLAZE dehumidifiers adopt upgraded dehumidification technology. Ensure 800ml per day dehumidification (at 86℉, 80%RH), which is better than other mini dehumidifiers. The dehumidifiers are suitable for small spaces up to 500 sq. ft like bedrooms, bathrooms, kitchen, etc. Say goodbye to the moisture, keep your home in a comfortable environment. 2.💧 FASHION DESIGN WITH LED DISPLAY: Everyone deserves to own a fashionable and modern dehumidifier.Our dehumidifiers with a LED display are different from other traditional dehumidifiers, which can show the humidity and temperature at any time. Humidity and temperature are visible at a glance. It is not only a dehumidifier but also a decoration for your bedroom, bathroom, kitchen, or any small space. 3.💧UNIQUE NEW HUMIDITY SETTING FUNCTION: The electrical dehumidifier creates a healthy and comfortable environment with a humidity setting function. Our mini dehumidifiers can be set the desired humidity environment range from 40%RH (Relative Humidity) to 70%RH (Relative Humidity) in 5% increments. 4.💧TIMER AND AUTO SHUT OFF FUNCTION: There is a timer button on our dehumidifiers, press to set the timing of Delay-off and Delay-on by a 1-hour increment up to 24 hours. Also, when the water tank is full, the dehumidifier will stop working automatically. No worry about the water is overflowing. Double functions, it's safe for 24 hours around running even no one is at home. 5.💧ULTRA-QUIET OPERATION: The portable dehumidifiers adopt semiconductor refrigeration technology, not a compressor; the noise is below 39 Db. It is the best choice if you want a quiet but powerful dehumidifier. The other aspect, there are light control buttons on the dehumidifier; if you do not want the light to bother you when you sleep, press the buttons to turn off the light. 6. 💧NOTE: The temperature is in degrees Celsius and cannot be changed to Fahrenheit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uw5z-iLiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLAZE","source_asin":"B0B2881GZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2881GZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2881GZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
