window.products.push({"id":877877,"name":"Personalized Stand Up Paddle Board Girl Christmas Ornament – SUP Paddle Board Ornament – Kids Paddle Board Decor – Paddle Boat, Lake Kayak Ornament – ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717hgGR8-OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Stand Up Paddle Boards Ornament – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our beach ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your Xmas tree décor! Vibrant colors and festive details of a boy on a stand-up paddleboard. Remember the fun times you've had outdoors and honor your girl's favorite sport with this special custom adventure ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized Christmas vacation ornaments often arrive with messy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every beach girl ornament is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND nautical paddle board decor, Hawaii ornament, paddle board coach and teacher gifts you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – and your favorite sports team! Commemorate your choice athlete’s jersey number and your family’s favorite activity with these custom water sports decorations honoring the pastime you enjoy together every year! Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors, your girl's standup paddleboard ornament, travel theme party decoration and sea life ornament will make the family tree feel extra special and unique to your home. 24-Hour Order Processing – Our sports fan ornaments make beautiful swimmer gifts for girls, beach Christmas decor, world traveler gifts, triathlon gift and paddle boarding teacher appreciation gifts to cherish every holiday season. Your Olympics ornament will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a gift box, gift bag and gift tag – no need for wrapping! free custom personalization included with your sports Christmas ornaments. The perfect paddle board enthusiasts gift! Happy Travelers – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful, unique personalized sports and vacation ornaments for girls and families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom Xmas tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship, if for any reason you don’t love your paddle ornament, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717hgGR8-OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B09MZBVZNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MZBVZNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MZBVZNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
