window.products.push({"id":877880,"name":"West & Fifth Kaleidoscope Dome-Top Cold-Cup Tumbler with Straw, Holographic and Iridescent Water Bottle, 24 Ounces, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OQmeriF8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Need a way to keep your water or iced coffee cold throughout the day? West & Fifth introduces our handy kaleidoscope dome-top cold-cup reusable tumbler, the perfect tall tumbler for cold liquids that stands out from other cups. The outside is decorated with a solid-colored design and features a gorgeous dome lid. This textured tumbler holds 3 cups of your favorite beverage, or 24 oz. of liquid, and maintains the temperature inside to keep your drink refreshing for hours. The lid has a special rubber ring that keeps it twisted on tight while preventing any spill or leak accidents, and each straw has a stopper ring on the base that keeps it from falling out and adds extra leak protection.Made with sturdy polystyrene and safe food-grade materials, this tumbler can withstand daily use as you go about your routine. It is lightweight enough to carry to the office, to your car, to the gym, or around your home. Wrap up this tumbler to give to your loved ones as a fun way for them to stay hydrated while expressing their style. Find the cup you’ll love with our reusable tumbler options!All of our tumblers are 100% free of BPA, BPS, phthalates, and mercury for your safety and convenience. To wash your water and iced-coffee tumbler, remove the lid and straw to clean the inside. Wash the cup by hand in a sink, and let it dry before the next use. This tumbler should not be used with hot liquids. Do not put this item in the dishwasher or in the microwave.At West & Fifth, we believe that there’s no such thing as a one-size-fits-all product. All of our products are exclusive, as they are designed in-house using fun, vibrant, fashion-forward, and custom colors and designs. Since inception, we’ve designed and launched over a thousand other quality products. We’re constantly bringing new products to market to fit with current seasons, colors, and trends that we’re sure you’ll love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41OQmeriF8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEST & FIFTH","source_asin":"B0B94X4DDF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B94X4DDF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B94X4DDF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
