window.products.push({"id":877884,"name":"Sunnyglade 19.7\" X 31.5\" Non-Slip Microfiber Shag Bathroom Mat/Bathroom Carpet (Coarse, Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tdn+ijiWL._AC_.jpg","description":"100% chenille fabric microfiber <p>✔<br></p>[Super Soft & Shaggy and Dries Quickly] This mat is constructed with thousands of 1900g/m2 individual microfiber shags. It is super soft and shaggy. The mat's construction allows the water held in the mat to dry quickly, leaving the mat smelling and feeling clean, dry, and always free of any mold or mildew. The Sturdy design will keep the mat looking the same even after you just got out of the shower. <p>✔<br></p>[Anti-Skid Latex Backing] Features a non-skid, keeps the bath rug in place, even when wet. The durable non-slip backing will not fade, keeping the mat in place for years. The non-slip backing provides added piece of mind when used with children/kids or elders, keeping wet feet off of slipper tile and off of a slippery bathroom rug. <p>✔<br></p> [Easy Care] Machine washable. Simply toss the whole mat into the washing machine, wash cold, hang to dry or air dry flat. Please do NOT use the dryer or put it in Hot water. The super soft microfiber material will not shrink or turn rough after the wash, keeping your bathroom rug in the same shape as the day you bought it. <p>✔<br></p>[Multiuse] This is just what you need to protect your feet from the cold floor as well as your bathroom floor. Large size and 2 colors, you are sure to find one to suit your room style. Perfect for bathrooms, toilet, shower, floor, kitchen. Also your pets will love it maybe. <p>✔<br></p>[New Again] Machine washable (gentle cycle), put it in the tumble dryer to fluff it up, and the rug will look new again. We believe in our shag bathroom mat quality. If you have any problem or suggestion, please kindly contact us freely, we provide friendly, easy-to-reach support for you. There may be a little color difference due to your display effect.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tdn+ijiWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunnyglade","source_asin":"B075QZ6QC7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075QZ6QC7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075QZ6QC7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":877885,"name":"Lush Decor Black Vintage Rose Butterfly 2-Piece Window Panel Set, Long Floral Polyester Curtains with Paris-Themed Pattern (84\" x 52\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kFSUP4MSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for curtains that can improve the appearance of your room? Give your windows a touch of European charm with the Lush Decor Black Vintage Paris Rose Butterfly 2-Piece Window Curtain Panel Set! Finding the right size, color, and fabric type to complement your interior home design makes the search for living room, master bedroom, or guest bedroom curtains just another stressful chore to add to your checklist. At Lush Decor, we want to help make shopping for home decor fun and stress-free. Our Vintage Paris Rose Butterfly Curtains are the perfect long floral curtains for any room in your home. This 2-piece curtain panel set exudes a stylish vintage vibe with a pattern that will remind you of all things Paris. The butterflies, roses, Eiffel Tower silhouettes, postal service stamps, and script are striking and elegant against the rich, dark background. The gorgeous design is eye-catching but will beautifully accent many design styles.Our curtains are made of 100% polyester, which is known for its strength and non-wrinkling properties. They are easy to wash; simply machine wash them in a mesh bag on a cold, gentle cycle, and then hang to dry. You can rest assured that the print won’t fade or bleed in the wash. Lightly iron the curtains if needed. Installation should be just as easy as washing and maintaining your curtains, so we include grommets and a 3-inch back tab rod pocket to make insertion, removal, and adjustments easy and convenient.At Lush Decor, we offer a range of home products that are luxurious yet affordable. All of our products are made by a team of in-house designers who aim to create items that are functional, fashionable, and unique. Shop our line of home accessories, ranging from curtains to bedding. Add the Lush Decor Vintage Paris Rose Butterfly 2-Piece Window Curtain Panel Set to your home for an elegant, vintage accent that will instantly elevate the look of any room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kFSUP4MSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B08432NP68","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-877885","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08432NP68","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08432NP68","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
